In the previous levels, you worked with **print statements** and strings.

<div role="group" aria-label="Python code and its printed output" style="max-width:420px; margin:20px 0; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.18); font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7;">

